WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.300
First: a security advisory's
summary is empty in the record.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.850
What's the likely cause?

4
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.075
The answer is b.

5
00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.652
The reader holds Reader but not
Service Health Security Reader,

6
00:00:12.652 --> 00:00:14.475
which the sensitive fields need.

7
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:17.785
Reader and Monitoring Reader
can list the advisory,

8
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:20.787
but can't see its summary
or impacted resources.

9
00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:24.488
Second: the same incident
appears in two subscriptions.

10
00:00:24.488 --> 00:00:26.588
How many notices does the kit write?

11
00:00:26.588 --> 00:00:28.424
The answer is b, one.

12
00:00:28.424 --> 00:00:32.415
Rows are merged by tracking I
D, so one event is one notice,

13
00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:35.537
and later one task, not
one per subscription.

14
00:00:35.537 --> 00:00:37.965
The module page has three more questions,

15
00:00:37.965 --> 00:00:40.510
each linked to the
section that answers it.
